{"id":"c0782b725f569c3a","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-dfa-structure.md","title":"Deterministic Finite Automaton","display":"df-deterministic-finite-automaton — Deterministic Finite Automaton","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-dfa-structure","aliases":["73-df-dfa-structure","73-df-deterministic-finite-automaton"],"display":"df-deterministic-finite-automaton — Deterministic Finite Automaton","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-dfa-structure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-dfa-structure</span><span>73-df-deterministic-finite-automaton</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-deterministic-finite-automaton — Deterministic Finite Automaton"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (alphabet, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (candidate five-tuple)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}finite\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\land\n0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\n\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\land\nq_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}finite\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\land\n\\exists Q\\,\\exists\\delta\\,\\exists q_0\\,\\exists F\\;\\Bigl(\nM=(Q,\\Sigma,\\delta,q_0,F)\\land\n0&lt;|Q|&lt;\\aleph_0\\land\n\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\land\nq_0\\in Q\\land F\\subseteq Q\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}finite\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}deterministic\\text{-}finite\\text{-}automaton}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{DFA}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{M:\\operatorname{DFA}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Totality and single-valuedness are carried by the function signature <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\">\\(\\delta:Q\\times\\Sigma\\to Q\\)</span>; finiteness of the state set is explicit.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-f